      "title": "Generally Available: Azure 248 and 372 vCPU sizes for D/E v7 series VMs ",
      "description": "<p>Azure announces the general availability of 248 and 372 vCPU Dl/D/E v7 VM sizes, powered by Intel® Xeon® 6 processors. These general-purpose and memory-optimized VMs deliver up to 20% better compute performance than prior-generation Intel-based v6 VMs, with major scale, networking, and storage gains.&nbsp;</p><p>The new VMs scale to 372 vCPUs and 2.8 TiB of memory, enabling larger in-memory databases, agentic AI workloads with larger context windows, and lower-latency applications through fewer cross-node network hops.&nbsp;</p><p>The 248 and 372 vCPU VMs enable&nbsp;Dlsv7, Dsv7, and Esv7 VMs&nbsp;to&nbsp;deliver the highest networking, remote storage, and local storage specs across comparable VMs from leading&nbsp;hyperscalers, driven by the latest capabilities of <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/virtual-machines/boost\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Azure Boost</a>:&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-list=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p>Higher Networking Bandwidth - Up to 400 Gbps networking bandwidth with the&nbsp;372 vCPU&nbsp;Esv7/Edsv7 size&nbsp;</p></li><li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-list=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p>Faster Remote Storage - Up to 800k IOPS and 20&nbsp;GBps&nbsp;throughput&nbsp;to Premium v2 SSD and Ultra Disk remote storage with the 372 vCPU Esv7/Edsv7 size&nbsp;</p></li><li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-list=\"\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><p>Improved Local Storage Performance - Up to 9.6M IOPS and 53&nbsp;GBps&nbsp;throughput to local&nbsp;NVMe&nbsp;temp disk with the 372 vCPU Ddsv7/Edsv7 sizes&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p>These VMs are&nbsp;now generally available in Central US,&nbsp;East US, East US 2,&nbsp;Germany West Central,&nbsp;South Central&nbsp;US, Sweden Central, West US 2, and West US 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Learn more:&nbsp;</p><ul type=\"disc\">\n <li><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fvirtual-machines%2Fsizes%2Fgeneral-purpose%2Fdsv7-series%3Ftabs%3Dsizebasic&amp;data=05%7C02%7Crishigomatam%40microsoft.com%7Ce61dd48f8c9841f8f3e508de8f7d6f92%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639105966086019514%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=awkIovcFGzV7LkroZdbjc7jbUQLqDI5G%2B8ZweKp5I4M%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Dsv7</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fvirtual-machines%2Fsizes%2Fgeneral-purpose%2Fddsv7-series%3Ftabs%3Dsizebasic&amp;data=05%7C02%7Crishigomatam%40microsoft.com%7Ce61dd48f8c9841f8f3e508de8f7d6f92%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639105966086035162%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=LJhaX7LoeHyVoBFF6YfVh1D%2BwcPizW0Jinq4KGlzl4o%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Ddsv7</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n 